From u0c39e60ddb38622b at groups.google.com  Fri Jan 14 02:11:15 2011
From: u0c39e60ddb38622b at groups.google.com (Dennis Murphy)
Date: Fri, 14 Jan 2011 02:11:15 +0000
Subject: Re: Can't make the option value.name work in reshape2::melt()
Message-ID: <scoTBPEtLwM.SCLVC1eBj_kJ@manipulatr.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <scoTBPEtLwM.ThiPRW_qgm8J@manipulatr.groups.google.com>
References: <scoTBPEtLwM.ThiPRW_qgm8J@manipulatr.groups.google.com>
